// Witness traces for auction (2 interactive rounds)
// Round 1: a bidder must be able to withdraw after the auction ends
constructor 1
bid 2 100 | 2 0
endAuction | 0 0
withdraw 2 100 | 2 0
---
// Round 2: second bidder displaces first; first bidder withdraws losing bid
constructor 1
bid 2 50 | 2 0
bid 3 100 | 3 0
endAuction | 0 0
withdraw 2 50 | 2 0
